{"beat": 34, "name": "THE HILL", "text": "Now picture profit as the price sweeps upward. Every unit you still sell earns more. You sell fewer units. They pull against each other, so for most products profit climbs, flattens, then falls. It's a hill. Its top sits where the slope and the margin put it, but only as sharply as the slope is known. In this demo, for 22 of the 22 products it measured, the range on the slope is too wide for the model to mark the top. The honest thing it can say is how far it can't see. Woolworth's ceiling set every product in his stores at the same point on the price axis, whatever its hill looked like. From one price that never moved, there was no way to see any of it.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "Now", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.22}, {"word": "picture", "start": 0.22, "end": 0.6}, {"word": "profit", "start": 0.6, "end": 1.1}, {"word": "as", "start": 1.1, "end": 1.36}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.36, "end": 1.5}, {"word": "price", "start": 1.5, "end": 1.8}, {"word": "sweeps", "start": 1.8, "end": 2.2}, {"word": "upward.", "start": 2.2, "end": 2.56}, {"word": "Every", "start": 3.18, "end": 3.44}, {"word": "unit", "start": 3.44, "end": 3.74}, {"word": "you", "start": 3.74, "end": 3.94}, {"word": "still", "start": 3.94, "end": 4.18}, {"word": "sell", "start": 4.18, "end": 4.52}, {"word": "earns", "start": 4.52, "end": 4.88}, {"word": "more.", "start": 4.88, "end": 5.24}, {"word": "You", "start": 5.84, "end": 5.94}, {"word": "sell", "start": 5.94, "end": 6.24}, {"word": "fewer", "start": 6.24, "end": 6.68}, {"word": "units.", "start": 6.68, "end": 7.1}, {"word": "They", "start": 7.7, "end": 7.84}, {"word": "pull", "start": 7.84, "end": 8.06}, {"word": "against", "start": 8.06, "end": 8.38}, {"word": "each", "start": 8.38, "end": 8.66}, {"word": "other,", "start": 8.66, "end": 8.94}, {"word": "so", "start": 9.08, "end": 9.2}, {"word": "for", "start": 9.2, "end": 9.34}, {"word": "most", "start": 9.34, "end": 9.58}, {"word": "produ